            "state": "translated",
            "value": "盼望"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you stop the alarm without finishing the verse, it rings again until you do.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果沒有完成經文就停止鬧鐘，鬧鐘會再次響起，直到你完成為止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you stop the alarm without reading, it rings again every few minutes until you finish the verse. Bible Alarm needs your permission to ring, even in Silent mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如果沒讀經文就停止鬧鐘，它會每隔幾分鐘再響，直到你完成經文。Bible Alarm 需要你的允許才能響鈴，即使在靜音模式也一樣。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Journey": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "歷程"
